  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Border Management Capacities with Biometric Documentation Processing and Registration Equipment in the Republic of Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to enable the Bureau for Migration and Asylum (BMA) of the Ministry of Interior (MOI) of the Republic of Moldova to process an increased number of document authenticity verification tasks throughout the entire national territory in the context of an increased overall flow of refugees and third-country nationals. The project builds on a well-established operational partnership between IOM and the BMA, centered on capacity development and operational support, which has been strengthened since 24 February 2022 in the context of urgent institutional support needs.</narrative>
  </description>
